• ನಂತರ ಗಿಡಗಳ ಬುಡಕ್ಕೆ ಮಣ್ಣನ್ನು ಏರಿಹಾಕುವುದು', 'ದುಂಡಾಣು ಕಪ್ಪು ಕೊಳೆ ರೋಗ ಕಂಡುಬಂದಲ್ಲಿ ಲೀ. ನೀರಿಗೆ 0.5 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಸ್ಟ್ರೆಪ್ಟೊಸೈಕ್ಲಿನ್ ಅಥವಾ 100 ಮಿ. ಗ್ರಾಂ ಟೆಟ್ರಾಸೈಕ್ಲಿನ್ ಹೈಡ್ರಾಕ್ಸೈಡ್ ಅಥವಾ 0.5 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಸ್ಟ್ರೆಪ್ಟೋಮೈಸಿನ್ ಸಲ್ಟೇಟ್ ಅಥವಾ 3 ಗ್ರಾಂ ತಾಮ್ರದ ಆಕ್ಸಿಕ್ಲೋರೈಡ್‌ನ್ನು ಬೆರೆಸಿ  ಸಿಂಪಡಿಸುವುದು', '• Weed management through intercropping and top dressing with 50% of the recommended nitrogen based on LRI
• Then mulching the soil around the base of the plants', 'If roundworm black rot disease is found, spray with 0.5 g streptocycline or 100 mg tetracycline hydroxide or 0.5 g streptomycin sulfate or 3 g copper oxychloride per liter of water', NULL, NULL, 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
INSERT INTO "KSNDMC"."HORTI_WEEKS_CROPS_ADVISORY" ("HORTI_WEEK_ADVISORY_ID", "CROP_NAME", "CROP_ID", "CROP_PERIOD_IN_WEEKS", "WEEKS_IN_NUMBER", "GROWTH_STAGE", "GROWTH_STAGE_NUMBER", "PREVIOUS_WEEK_RAINFALL", "NEXT_WEEK_RAINFALL_FORECAST", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_KN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_KN", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_EN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_EN", "REMARKS", "CROP_MATURITY_IN_DAYS", "REGION_CODE", "CREATED_DATE", "CREATED_BY", "UPDATED_DATE", "UPDATED_BY", "IS_ACTIVE") VALUES (1422, 'CABBAGE', 13, N'3-6 weeks', N'3-6', 'Growth stage', 3, 'BELOW NORMAL', 'YES', '• ಅಂತರ ಬೇಸಾಯದ ಮೂಲಕ ಕಳೆ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ ಮಾಡಿ, LRI ಆಧರಿಸಿ ಶಿಫಾರಸ್ಸು ಮಾಡಿದ ಶೇ. 50 ರಷ್ಟು ಸಾರಜನಕವನ್ನು ಮೇಲು ಗೊಬ್ಬರವಾಗಿ ಕೊಡುವುದು
• ನಂತರ ಗಿಡಗಳ ಬುಡಕ್ಕೆ ಮಣ್ಣನ್ನು ಏರಿಹಾಕುವುದು', 'ಎಲೆ ಮಚ್ಚೆ ರೋಗಕ್ಕೆ ಬಿತ್ತನೆಯಾದ 2 ಮತ್ತು4 ವಾರಗಳ ನಂತರ ಸಸಿ ಮಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಸಸಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಪ್ರತಿ ಲೀಟರ್ ನೀರಿಗೆ 3 ಗ್ರಾಂ ತಾಮ್ರದ ಆಕ್ಸಿಕ್ಲೋರೈಡ್ 50 WP ಬೆರೆಸಿ ಸಿಂಪಡಿಸುವುದು. ಸಸಿಗಳನ್ನು ನಾಟಿ ಮಾಡಿದ 6 ಮತ್ತು 8 ವಾರಗಳ ನಂತರ 3 ಗ್ರಾಂ ತಾಮ್ರದ ಆಕ್ಸಿಕ್ಲೋರೈಡ್  50 WP  ಪ್ರತಿ ಲೀಟರ್ ನೀರಿಗೆ ಸೇರಿಸಿ ಸಿಂಪಡಿಸುವುದು', '• Weed management through intercropping and top dressing with 50% of the recommended nitrogen based on LRI
• Then mulching the soil around the base of the plants', 'For leaf spot disease, spray the seedlings in the seedling bed at 2 and 4 weeks after sowing by mixing 3 grams of copper oxychloride 50 WP per liter of water. Spray the seedlings at 6 and 8 weeks after transplanting by mixing 3 grams of copper oxychloride 50 WP per liter of water', NULL, NULL, 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
INSERT INTO "KSNDMC"."HORTI_WEEKS_CROPS_ADVISORY" ("HORTI_WEEK_ADVISORY_ID", "CROP_NAME", "CROP_ID", "CROP_PERIOD_IN_WEEKS", "WEEKS_IN_NUMBER", "GROWTH_STAGE", "GROWTH_STAGE_NUMBER", "PREVIOUS_WEEK_RAINFALL", "NEXT_WEEK_RAINFALL_FORECAST", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_KN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_KN", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_EN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_EN", "REMARKS", "CROP_MATURITY_IN_DAYS", "REGION_CODE", "CREATED_DATE", "CREATED_BY", "UPDATED_DATE", "UPDATED_BY", "IS_ACTIVE") VALUES (1427, 'CABBAGE', 13, N'7-8 weeks', N'7-8', 'Head initiation stage', 4, 'NORMAL', 'NO', 'ಅಂತರ ಬೇಸಾಯದ ಮೂಲಕ ಕಳೆ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ ಮಾಡುವುದು', '•ಎಲೆ ಸುಡುವ ಹಾಗೂ ಬುಡ ಕೊಳೆಯುವ ರೋಗಕ್ಕೆ 2.0 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಮ್ಯಾಂಕೋಜೆಬ್ 75 WP ಅಥವಾ 2.0 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಕ್ಲೋರೋಥಲೋನಿಲ್ 70 WP ಅಥವಾ 3. 0 ಗ್ರಾಂ ತಾಮ್ರದ ಆಕ್ಸಿಕ್ಲೋರೈಡ್ 50 WP ಸೇರಿಸಿ ಸಿಂಪಡಿಸುವುದು
•ಬಿಳಿ ತುಕ್ಕು ರೋಗ ಕಂಡುಬಂದರೆ ಲೀ. ನೀರಿಗೆ 2.0 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಮ್ಯಾಂಕೋಜೆಬ್ 75 WP ಅಥವಾ 2.0 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಜೈನೆಬ್ 75 WP ಅಥವಾ 2.0 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಮೆಟಲಾಕ್ಸಿಲ್ 18 + ಮ್ಯಾಂಕೋಜೆಬ್ 64 WP ಸೇರಿಸಿ ಸಿಂಪಡಿಸುವುದು', 'Weed management through intercropping', '•For leaf scorch and stem rot, spray 2.0 g Mancozeb 75 WP or 2.0 g Chlorothalonil 70 WP or 3. 0 g Copper Oxychloride 50 WP. •If white rust is found, spray 2.0 g Mancozeb 75 WP or 2.0 g Zaineb 75 WP or 2.0 g Metalaxyl 18 + Mancozeb 64 WP per liter of water', NULL, NULL, 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
INSERT INTO "KSNDMC"."HORTI_WEEKS_CROPS_ADVISORY" ("HORTI_WEEK_ADVISORY_ID", "CROP_NAME", "CROP_ID", "CROP_PERIOD_IN_WEEKS", "WEEKS_IN_NUMBER", "GROWTH_STAGE", "GROWTH_STAGE_NUMBER", "PREVIOUS_WEEK_RAINFALL", "NEXT_WEEK_RAINFALL_FORECAST", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_KN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_KN", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_EN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_EN", "REMARKS", "CROP_MATURITY_IN_DAYS", "REGION_CODE", "CREATED_DATE", "CREATED_BY", "UPDATED_DATE", "UPDATED_BY", "IS_ACTIVE") VALUES (1428, 'CABBAGE', 13, N'7-8 weeks', N'7-8', 'Head initiation stage', 4, 'BELOW NORMAL', 'YES', 'ಅಂತರ ಬೇಸಾಯದ ಮೂಲಕ ಕಳೆ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ ಮಾಡುವುದು', NULL, 'Weed management through intercropping', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
INSERT INTO "KSNDMC"."HORTI_WEEKS_CROPS_ADVISORY" ("HORTI_WEEK_ADVISORY_ID", "CROP_NAME", "CROP_ID", "CROP_PERIOD_IN_WEEKS", "WEEKS_IN_NUMBER", "GROWTH_STAGE", "GROWTH_STAGE_NUMBER", "PREVIOUS_WEEK_RAINFALL", "NEXT_WEEK_RAINFALL_FORECAST", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_KN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_KN", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_EN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_EN", "REMARKS", "CROP_MATURITY_IN_DAYS", "REGION_CODE", "CREATED_DATE", "CREATED_BY", "UPDATED_DATE", "UPDATED_BY", "IS_ACTIVE") VALUES (1429, 'CABBAGE', 13, N'7-8 weeks', N'7-8', 'Head initiation stage', 4, 'BELOW NORMAL', 'NO', '• ಅಂತರ ಬೇಸಾಯದ ಮೂಲಕ ಕಳೆ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ ಮಾಡುವುದು
• ಕೃಷಿ ಹೊಂಡ, ಇತರ ಮೂಲಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಲಭ್ಯವಿರುವ ನೀರನ್ನು ಬಳಸಿ ಸಂರಕ್ಷಣಾ ನೀರಾವರಿ ಕೊಡುವುದು', NULL, '• Weed management through intercropping
• Conservation irrigation using water available from agricultural wells and other sources', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
INSERT INTO "KSNDMC"."HORTI_WEEKS_CROPS_ADVISORY" ("HORTI_WEEK_ADVISORY_ID", "CROP_NAME", "CROP_ID", "CROP_PERIOD_IN_WEEKS", "WEEKS_IN_NUMBER", "GROWTH_STAGE", "GROWTH_STAGE_NUMBER", "PREVIOUS_WEEK_RAINFALL", "NEXT_WEEK_RAINFALL_FORECAST", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_KN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_KN", "AGRICULTURE_MEASURES_EN", "PLANT_PROTECTION_MEARURES_EN", "REMARKS", "CROP_MATURITY_IN_DAYS", "REGION_CODE", "CREATED_DATE", "CREATED_BY", "UPDATED_DATE", "UPDATED_BY", "IS_ACTIVE") VALUES (1430, 'CABBAGE', 13, N'7-8 weeks', N'7-8', 'Head initiation stage', 4, 'ABOVE NORMAL', 'YES', 'ಹಿಂದಿನ ದಿನಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಅಧಿಕ ಮಳೆಯಾಗಿದ್ದರೆ, ಜಮೀನಿನಲ್ಲಿ ನೀರು ನಿಲ್ಲದಂತೆ ಬಸಿದುಹೋಗಲು ಅನುವುಮಾಡಿಕೊಡಿ', 'ಬಿಳಿ ತುಕ್ಕು ರೋಗಕ್ಕೆ ಪ್ರತಿ ಲೀಟರ್ ನೀರಿಗೆ 2 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಮ್ಯಾಂಕೋಜೆಬ್ 75 WP ಅಥವಾ 2.0 ಗ್ರಾಂ ಜೈನೆಬ್ 75 WP ಬೆರೆಸಿದ ದ್ರಾವಣ ಸಿಂಪಡಣೆಯನ್ನು ಕೈಕೊಳ್ಳುವುದು ಉತ್ತಮ', 'If there has been heavy rainfall in the past few days, allow the water to drain away so that it does not stagnate in the field.', 'For white rust, it is best to spray a solution of 2 g Mancozeb 75 WP or 2.0 g Zaineb 75 WP per liter of water', NULL, NULL, 'NIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
