• ನಂತರ LRI ಆಧರಿಸಿ ಶಿಫಾರಸ್ಸು ಮಾಡಿದ ರಸಗೊಬ್ಬರಗಳನ್ನು ಒದಗಿಸುವುದು', NULL, '• Planting tissue seedlings/roots if irrigation facilities are available, watering immediately after planting
• Then providing recommended fertilizers based on LRI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
