• Intercrop twice at 5 weeks interval, provide recommended fertilizer based on LRI and till the soil', '•For Panama leaf blight, dissolve 100 grams of Carbendazim 50 WP or Metham Sodium in 100 liters of water and pour it on the soil around the plant. •If freckle leaf spot is found, spray 2.5 grams of Mancozeb 75 WP and 3 grams of Copper Oxychloride 50 WP mixed in each liter of water', NULL, NULL, 'SIK', TO_TIMESTAMP('2026-05-26 15:47:54', 'YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'), NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y');
